Fresh independent hold-out replication for the outward radial gain dose response. Primary preregistered contrast from the exploratory 1810–1829 run: init_scale=0.16, outward_gain=0.5 versus local at branch_step=40, emphasizing hard margin and soft margin, with CE/accuracy/finite as corroborating outcomes. Secondary: compare gain=0.5 against gain=0 and gain=1, and test whether the full gain-response remains non-monotonic rather than assuming a linear outward-is-bad law.
